摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"One-click restart button for the DeepSeek Harness Web UI: sidebar footer button, single click restarts the dsh web process. / DSH Web 界面一键重启按钮。","id":"gh:1335060007","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-web-restart","slug":"1123762794/dsh-web-restart","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","restart","ui"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"One-click restart button for the DeepSeek Harness Web UI: sidebar footer button, single click restar"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ts the dsh web process. / DSH Web 界面一键重启按钮。"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-web-restart"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"One-click restart button for the **DeepSeek Harness Web UI**."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Adds a small circular restart button (↻) to the sidebar footer, next to Settings. A **single click**"},{"id":"p4s2","text":" immediately restarts the `dsh web` process — the page disconnects for ~15–20 seconds, then you refr"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"esh and everything is back (sessions are persisted on disk and recover automatically). The button is"},{"id":"p4s4","text":" **persistent**: it survives the restart it triggers."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> Windows-specific: the restart launches `dsh web` through an independent hidden PowerShell process,"},{"id":"p5s2","text":" so the script keeps running after the harness process is killed."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- Single-click restart — no confirmation step, no double-click dance.\n- Persistent: survives the DSH"},{"id":"p7s2","text":" restart it triggers (installed as a bundle-layer plugin, not a dynamic session plugin).\n- Small foo"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"tprint: sits beside the Settings trigger in the sidebar footer; icon-only in the 56px rail, icon + l"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"abel in the wide sidebar.\n- In-flight feedback: the button turns red and shows \"重启中…\" → \"已触发\" while "},{"id":"p7s5","text":"the request is being processed.\n- Re-entry guard: a second click while a restart is already in fligh"},{"id":"p7s6","text":"t is rejected.\n- Online status dot: the button also shows DSH liveness — a green dot polls `GET /dsh"},{"id":"p7s7","text":"-health` every 5s (red when the harness is unreachable/restarting)."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"### From GitHub (this repo)"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Then restart `dsh web` once so the bundle layer loads."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### Manual (edit profile files)"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"1. Add the dependency:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"2. Add the plugin row (this repo ships its own `cordis.patch.yml` — either merge its row into your p"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"rofile's `cordis.patch.yml`, or install via the `dsh plugin` command above which does it for you):"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"3. `pnpm install` in the profile directory, then restart `dsh web`."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"| Layer | File | What it does |"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| Host | `lib/index.js` | Registers an exact `POST /restart-dsh` route on the webServer; launches th"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"e restart script as an independent hidden PowerShell under `danger-full-access` sandbox policy |\n| C"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"lient | `lib/client.js` | Registers the sidebar footer button (slot `sidebar.footer.action`); single"},{"id":"p20s4","text":" click `fetch`es `POST /restart-dsh`; polls `GET /dsh-health` every 5s for the status dot |\n| Bundle"},{"id":"p20s5","text":" | `cordis.patch.yml` | The loader row that mounts both halves |"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"The host routes return **before** the restart happens (~1s host timer + 3s inner sleep), giving the "},{"id":"p21s2","text":"browser time to render the \"restarting\" state before the page drops."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"### Why not `ctx.timeout` in the route handler"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"`ctx.timeout` is a Cordis mixin backed by `ctx.effect()`, which is scoped to the Cordis **fiber** li"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"fecycle. A `webServer` route handler runs as a plain Node HTTP callback — outside any fiber — so `ct"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"x.effect`-registered timers are silently dropped and the restart never fires. This plugin uses Node'"},{"id":"p23s4","text":"s native `setTimeout` in the handler instead."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"- DeepSeek Harness `0.1.0-rc.6` (web profile).\n- The restart script path (`D:\\1\\dsh-web-host.ps1`) i"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"s hard-coded for this author's machine — **fork and adjust it** (or replace the command in `lib/inde"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"x.js`) for your own environment. Contributions to make this configurable are welcome."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"The client bundle is hand-written in the exact wire format (`window.__ModuleLoader__.load({ id, fact"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"ory })`), so no build step is required:"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
